16
00:00:46,160 --> 00:00:50,840
(Sheldon(voice):)It's your old buddy
Sheldonoscopy!

17
00:00:50,932 --> 00:00:53,272
(Sheldon(voice):)How come you didn't
pick up the phone?

18
00:00:53,434 --> 00:01:00,024
(Sheldon(voice):)Oh, right. My bad.

